## Available Scripts

- `dev` - Start all apps in development mode
- `build` - Build all apps for production
{{#if (hasRootScript "start")}}
- `start` - Start all apps in production mode
{{/if}}
{{#if (hasRootScript "db:migrate")}}
- `db:migrate` - Run database migrations
{{/if}}
{{#if (hasRootScript "db:push")}}
- `db:push` - Push schema changes to database
{{/if}}
{{#if (hasRootScript "db:studio")}}
- `db:studio` - Open database management UI
{{/if}}
{{#if (has "linter" "biome")}}
- `lint` - Lint and fix code with Biome
- `format` - Format code with Biome
- `check` - Run both linting and formatting
{{/if}}
{{#if (has "linter" "oxc")}}
- `lint` - Lint code with Oxlint
- `format` - Format code with Oxfmt
- `check` - Fix lint issues, then format
{{/if}}

